# Mixed @Expr and non-@Expr params: name@String evaluated, body@Expr quoted
[
  define-adder: [fn [let name@String body@Expr __call-env__ __call-span__]
                  [eval-macro-ast [quote [str name ": " [str [unquote body]]]]]]
  result: [define-adder "answer" [+ 40 2]]
]
[result]
=== out
String("answer: 42")
